==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{proto|Slavic|uxo|lang=ru}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|h₂ous-|lang=ru}}. Cognate with Old Armenian {{term|ունկն||sc=Armn|tr=unkn|lang=xcl}}, Gothic {{term|𐌰𐌿𐍃𐍉|tr=auso|sc=Goth|lang=got}}, Ancient Greek {{term|οὖς|tr=oûs|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}}, Latin {{term|auris|lang=la}}, Modern Persian {{term|sc=fa-Arab|گوش|tr=guš|lang=fa}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈuxə/|lang=ru}}
* {{audio|Ru-ухо.ogg|Audio}}

===Noun===
{{head|ru|noun|g=n|tr=úxo}}

# [[ear]]

